{"id":"0af633d4bf6ec4ec7801fb1d0da7ba885d830ceb","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"0af633d4bf6ec4ec7801fb1d0da7ba885d830ceb","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/cargo-registry-auth.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+Cargo index and crate downloads now use URL-matched credentials from pnpm configuration. The crates.io index also supports `CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN` and the token in `$CARGO_HOME/credentials.toml`, using Cargo's bare `Authorization` header format."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"Cargo.lock","lines":["@@ -4408,6 +4408,7 @@ dependencies = [","  \"tempfile\",","  \"text-block-macros\",","  \"tokio\",","+ \"toml\",","  \"tracing\",","  \"url\",","  \"walkdir\","],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"Cargo.toml","lines":["@@ -206,6 +206,7 @@ tower-http         = { version = \"0.7.0\", features = [\"compression-gzip\", \"cors\""," tracing            = { version = \"0.1.44\" }"," tracing-subscriber = { version = \"0.3.23\", features = [\"env-filter\"] }"," tokio              = { version = \"1\", features = [\"rt\", \"rt-multi-thread\", \"macros\", \"fs\", \"io-util\", \"net\", \"signal\", \"sync\"] }","+toml               = { version = \"1.1.5\" }"," url                = { version = \"2.5.8\" }"," walkdir            = { version = \"2.5.0\" }"," webpki-root-certs  = { version = \"1.0.7\" }"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/Cargo.toml","lines":["@@ -108,6 +108,7 @@ ssri                 = { workspace = true }"," tabled               = { workspace = true }"," tar                  = { workspace = true }"," tempfile             = { workspace = true }","+toml                 = { workspace = true }"," tokio                = { workspace = true, features = [\"process\"] }"," tracing              = { workspace = true }"," url                  = { workspace = true }"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/c